---
### Goals of a Symbol Table
...
{{color=math|Fast lookup}}
- If a lookup takes $O(n)$ time, compilation time becomes $O(n^2)$.
...
{{color=math|Mimics the structure of your programs}}
- If a variable is declared in a particular scope, that variable should{{br}}go away when you exit the scope.
...
{{color=math|Detailed Information about the symbols}}
- When you look up a symbol, it should give you all information you {{br}}might need about that symbol.

...
{size=60, rotate=30, color=#40C0FF} @(950,180) **Map?**
...
{size=60, rotate=30, color=#FF40C0} @(950,320) **Stack?**
...
{size=60, rotate=30, color=#C0FF40} @(950,500) **Structure?**
---
